RepoMemory sections consulted: core.architecture, core.where_to_edit, core.invariants, core.testing, core.gotchas, core.dependencies
2026-08-01: Characterized immutable full/fast evaluation behavior, official aggregation, task sizes, timestamp distribution, label-size distribution, schema coverage, installed APIs, and runtime resource limits.
2026-08-01: No external datasets or pretrained models used.
2026-08-01: Fast evaluation attempt 1 failed with `ValueError: Must produce aggregated value` in reconstructed episode creation; pandas 2.3 rejects ndarray-valued `GroupBy.agg`, fixed by using `GroupBy.apply`.
2026-08-01: Fast evaluation attempt 2 passed in 223.4 seconds; one-time feature construction took 207.9 seconds, each debug fold took about 2.3 seconds, and the registered fast MAP was 0.7076675485. Suppressed repeated sklearn feature-name warnings and strengthened the Model A immutability assertion.
2026-08-01: Forward-only Platt gate calibration was tested and rejected: eleven-fold selected-design mean MAP declined from 0.813310 to 0.812336. The production gate retains raw cross-fitted classifier probabilities; no official validation score drove this decision.
2026-08-01: Explicit one-season round shape, debut/comeback/full/partial cohort, constructor-change, and last-span interaction features were tested and rejected under the one-SE rule; selected-design forward MAP declined from 0.813616 with 92 features to 0.813376 with 104 features.
2026-08-01: Implemented the retained 92-feature Gated Calendar-Attendance LambdaMART pipeline, deterministic calendar floor, forward cross-fitted logistic host/attendance components, forward cross-fitted full-season gate, three-seed LambdaRank and binary companion ablations, one-SE selection, stable ranking, shared feature cache, Model A/Model B stage separation, prediction assertions, timing, and stratum diagnostics.
2026-08-01: The registered evaluator is immutable by task rule, so no file under kapso_evaluation was created or edited; the requested profile was persisted as measurement_profile.md and the system-provided kapso_evaluation/kapso_eval.py remains the executed evaluation entrypoint.
